{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 27, :comments ["<b>And you shall divide the spoil.</b> The word מלקוח here is a general term for human beings and beasts alike. And the Holy One, blessed be He, commanded that everything be divided between those who fought the battle and the whole congregation, and that those who fought the battle give from their share as a tax to the priests — one out of every five hundred — and that Israel give to the Levites from their share as a tax — one out of every fifty."], :book :numbers, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:37:24.853545903Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}